# gestures, from the 0.2 QA (2026-10-20): SEL as you let go keeps a gesture where it is (it had jumped: Shift's
# drones swapped); letting go only brings things back (Wash's reverb length had jumped to Inf on the way out)
set 74 0
tap PLAY
set 55 0
set 75 0
set 52 0
wait 2000
# Shift held 2.7 s (drone I there, drone II on its way), kept with SEL: drone I stays a fifth up
key w13 down
wait 2700
press SEL
key w13 up
release SEL
wait 1500
expect mpitch0 >650
tapkey w13
wait 8000
# Wash held 6 s, let go: the reverb's length goes back down, never up to Inf (100)
key w15 down
wait 6000
expect heard95 <90
key w15 up
wait 300
expect heard95 <90
wait 20000
expect heard95 <80
